{"root":"bincang","ipa":"/bin.tʃaŋ/","core":"指非正式的交谈、讨论或闲聊，通常涉及交换意见或信息。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/bin.tʃaŋ/","zh":"交谈，讨论，闲聊","phrases":[{"t":"bincang-bincang","zh":"闲聊，随便聊聊"},{"t":"bincang santai","zh":"轻松交谈"},{"t":"bahan bincang","zh":"讨论的话题"}],"examples":[{"t":"Kami sedang bincang soal rencana liburan.","zh":"我们正在讨论度假计划。"},{"t":"Mari kita bincang sebentar di kantor.","zh":"让我们在办公室简单聊聊。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"bincang","ipa":"/bin.tʃaŋ/","zh":"交谈，讨论","phrase":{"t":"bincang masalah","zh":"讨论问题"},"example":{"t":"Mereka bincang tentang masa depan.","zh":"他们讨论了关于未来的事情。"}},{"w":"berbincang","ipa":"/bər.bin.tʃaŋ/","zh":"进行交谈，商量","phrase":{"t":"berbincang serius","zh":"严肃地交谈"},"example":{"t":"Mereka sedang berbincang dengan atasan.","zh":"他们正在与上司商量。"}},{"w":"perbincangan","ipa":"/pər.bin.tʃa.ŋan/","zh":"讨论，谈话，商议","phrase":{"t":"hasil perbincangan","zh":"讨论的结果"},"example":{"t":"Perbincangan itu berlangsung selama dua jam.","zh":"那场讨论持续了两个小时。"}},{"w":"membincangkan","ipa":"/məm.bin.tʃaŋ.kan/","zh":"讨论某事，议论某事","phrase":{"t":"membincangkan isu","zh":"讨论议题"},"example":{"t":"Warga sedang membincangkan berita itu.","zh":"居民们正在议论那则新闻。"}}],"derSlugs":["bincang","berbincang","perbincangan","membincangkan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:25:41.537Z","src":"base"}